/v1/","context":{"app_id":2139040,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2139040","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:31:35Z","value":4,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5161320","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1846018067930182","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo AVAILABLE NOW! Let's Get Cookin!","summary":"That's right, you can download the demo RIGHT NOW! We have included four exclusive challenges to go for the gold in- enjoy! You can also play them via local co-op!Cook, Serve, Delicious: Remustard! is coming to Steam January 2027! Thanks so much for all of the support, and enjoy the delish dishes. ːcsd2smileː","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T15:34:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1845383656378787","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"update","title":"Big News Update Coming October 8th!","summary":"Hey everyone! Just a quick heads up that we got an exciting announcement coming your way October 8th! What could it possibly be? Find out...soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T19:42:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378787","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1841579228676956","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"announcement","title":"Co-Op Cookin' in Re-Mustard: First Details!","summary":"Howdy howdy howdy! It's time to learn all about the local multiplayer modes in CSD:R, but before we do make sure this baby is on your wishlists!On to the multiplayer!Have it Your WayThe original CSD had a distinct multiplayer mode separate from its sequels, and going into this project I wasn't sure which way we should go: have the multi be the Cook/Expedite mode from CSD 1, or the split screen multiplayer cooking from CSD 2 and 3? Ultimately I realized- we could just have both!So I'm happy to sa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T00:41:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228676956","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1836506165583983","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"announcement","title":"Cook, Serve, Delicious: Re-Mustard Gameplay Vid!","summary":"Hey everyone! I hope you're hungry because not only do we have a tasty daily deal for CSD 3 but we have another gameplay video for Cook, Serve, Delicious: Re-Mustard! Be sure to wishlist it today!Here's a little bit of early morning/rush hour cookin':The game is shaping up really nicely, so much so that we plan on announcing a release date very soon! In the meantime later this month I'm going to go over the new local multiplayer modes and features- be sure to check that out! Woo!-dev guy","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T16:46:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165583983","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1834602721185457","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"announcement","title":"Sneak Peak at the NEW Recipes in CSD: Re-Mustard!","summary":"Hey everyone! David here, and we've been hard at work at makin' the remake to Cook, Serve, Delicious! Be sure to grab a wishlist if you haven't already!Today I wanted to give a sneak peek at some of the new recipes you'll see in the game! A big new feature I wanted to add is the addition of making nearly all the foods in the game upgradeable to five stars. Three foods will only be one star foods (Pretzels, Corndogs and Hash Browns), but the rest will be fully upgradeable. In the first game, you ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T17:18:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721185457","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1828441623105082","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"announcement","title":"The Teaser Trailer for CSD: Re-Mustard is HERE!","summary":"Chefs! We're BACK with a brand new reveal trailer for Cook, Serve, Delicious: Re-Mustard! Be sure to wishlist it today!We're so excited for this release and I'm stoked to share even more news in the coming weeks. Enjoy this delicious teaser and get ready for the most delicious foods you've ever seen. Woo!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-27T16:46:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623105082","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1816307528922914","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update #04: Writing Recipes","summary":"We're making Cook, Serve, Delicious: Re-Mustard!, a brand new remake of our original game! So what's new narratively for CSDR? Find out in this guest blog by Cook Serve Delicious series writer Nicholas Kraak.It's hard to believe it's been over a decade since we released Cook Serve Delicious. Before I started working on Re-Mustard I went back read through everything we wrote for the original (which felt pretty nostalgic). CSD1 doesn't have a conventional story like Cook Serve Delicious 3 or Cook ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-13T19:37:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816307528922914","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1807332909738872","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"announcement","title":"Huge Dev Q&A! All the Details on Cook, Serve, Delicious: Re-Mustard!","summary":"Howdy folks! Here it is, the massive Q&A we've been compiling for a bit now for Cook, Serve, Delicious: Re-Mustard! Let's get right into it and as always follow me on Bluesky for more updates and be sure to wishlist and follow the game!Is Cook, Serve, Delicious: Re-Mustard! a remake, or a remaster, or what exactly?I would call CSD:R a \"re-imagining\" more than anything else. It is completely new code, using a lot of our ideas and influences from the sequels, while maintaining the \"spirit\" of the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-12T17:38:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909738872","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1803527891492357","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update #03: A Dash of Pepper","summary":"Development updates can be tough- we're making lots of progress on the back end of things and getting our pipelines sorted out, and before you know it I'll be able to share a ton of images and details on the game! But we're just not quite there yet, so instead I'm going to be sharing some random things we're doing for CSD: Re-Mustard! But before I do, I'm going to be doing a Q&A for the next update in August, so post any questions you have in the comments of this post and I'll answer it! Woo!Fir","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-26T01:55:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1803527891492357","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1794102528082061","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update #02: Music to Make Sausages To","summary":"When I was making Cook, Serve, Delicious! I wanted to make sure it had a great soundtrack. Music is one of the most important elements in a game, but the problem was, I didn't have quite enough money to be able to create an entire original soundtrack. Jonathan Geer (composer of the entire CSD series) and I had previously worked on several games before CSD, and we worked out a deal where I could have a soundtrack made at a nice discount as long as that music went royalty free a few months after l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-13T18:35:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794102528082061","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-1789580505351336","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"update","title":"Dev Update #01: New Beginnings","summary":"Hey everyone! There's a lot of reasons I'm excited for 2025, most of which is the fact that we're going full speed ahead on the remake of our 2012 classic, \"Cook, Serve, Delicious!\" I'm going to be posting bi-monthly updates from now until summer, where we'll likely switch to monthly updates, on the process of remaking this game, so be sure to follow CSD:R on Steam or follow me over on Bluesky for more updates! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44424893/d8d8f9d20ce4ef00d05a84e5c777d40418a6199a.png An old promo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-01-24T21:21:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1789580505351336","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2139040-5124584686246584713","game_id":"steam-2139040","kind":"announcement","title":"Cook, Serve, Delicious: Re-Mustard announced for 2024!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44424893/1906ce181032ce8924b2f37b0d579e0a0280e5ec.png I'm so excited to announce our next game, \"Cook, Serve, Delicious: Re-Mustard!\" is coming out in 2024! It's been ten years since our first CSD game hit Steam, and we've been doing numerous sequels and spinoffs ever since. Still there's always been a part of me that has wanted to go back and remake the original while keeping the same classic gameplay and style intact. We're going to have so much more to talk about in the mon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2023-07-27T16:34:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5124584686246584713","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2139040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2139040":"2026-10-25T23:59:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2139040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5161320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2139040","app_id":2139040,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:08Z","source_ur